## IMPORTANT DESIGN DECISIONS

**Credits:**
- Earned by completing challenges
- Used to purchase characters
- Stored individually for each player

**Characters:**
- Kael Voss is the default character
- Additional characters can be purchased
- Players can equip any character they own
- Characters are cosmetic only

**Planets:**
- Unlocked through rank or mission progression
- Do not require spending Credits
- Locked planets cannot be accessed through direct URLs

**Security:**
- Server validates all rewards and purchases
- Users cannot modify their Credits directly
- Purchases and balance updates must be atomic
- All player data belongs to the authenticated user

